{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"react","version":"v1","id":"index","title":"Overview","description":"What the library includes, what changed from the previous major, and where to start.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["React Layout is a React library for resource-based page layouts. You define the\nshared structure of your pages once, then create a typed component for each\nresource."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:blockquote","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Note:"]}," The examples in this section are adapted from the package's own documentation\nand tests for its last release. They were not compiled. The repository does not promise\nfixes to this major."]]},"\n"]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"core-ideas"},"children":["Core ideas"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:table","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"thead","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Term"]},{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Meaning"]},{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Example"]}]]}]},{"tag":"tbody","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Resource"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["A page or section of your app, named by a string."]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["users"]},", ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["users.detail"]}]]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Option"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["A typed value a page supplies when it is created."]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["title: 'Users'"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Layout"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["The shared render function that turns options into markup."]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["layout.render"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr"